cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this library, please cite it as below."
title: "OscInt: uniform oscillatory-integral estimates in Lean 4 and Mathlib"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 + Mathlib library of machine-checked uniform oscillatory-integral estimates in one and two variables: van
  der Corput's lemma with explicit constants, non-stationary and nondegenerate stationary phase, the uniform fold
  and D4 (umbilic) estimates with the D4 leading term and its closed-form constant, and front ends in Mathlib's
  idiom. Statements are frozen and timestamped before their proofs and replayed by several independent kernels.
